*> arithmetic: every verb and a few expressions
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ARITH.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 A          PIC 9(4)    VALUE 10.
01 B          PIC 9(4)    VALUE 3.
01 C          PIC S9(6)V99 VALUE ZERO.
01 TOTAL-AMT  PIC 9(7)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
01 REMAINDR   PIC 9(4).
01 QUOT       PIC 9(4).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ADD A TO B
    ADD 1 2 3 TO A GIVING C ROUNDED
    SUBTRACT B FROM A
    SUBTRACT 1 FROM A GIVING C
    MULTIPLY A BY B GIVING C
    MULTIPLY 2 BY A
    DIVIDE A BY B GIVING QUOT REMAINDER REMAINDR
    DIVIDE B INTO A ROUNDED
    COMPUTE C = (A + B) * 2 - A / B ** 2
    COMPUTE C ROUNDED = - A + +B
        ON SIZE ERROR DISPLAY "overflow"
        NOT ON SIZE ERROR DISPLAY "fine"
    END-COMPUTE
    ADD 1 TO TOTAL-AMT ON SIZE ERROR STOP RUN END-ADD.
    STOP RUN.
